		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant height, but appears as the body of a naked, starving man with a jackal's head. Foot soldiers of Famine.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +4 (2d8 + wasting) and aura of consumption, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Aura of Consumption</strong>. All mortals within near, CHA 18+ or filled with hunger, DISADV on checks and attacks until fed. Immune for 1 day if passed check.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wasting</strong>. CON 18+ or 1d4 CHA damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CHA.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
